#. Description of the plugin
#: astro-booking-engine.php
msgid "Hotel booking form via Gutenberg block or shortcode, independent from the provider: switch booking engine anytime, your form stays the same."
msgstr "Formulario de reserva de hotel mediante bloque de Gutenberg o shortcode, independiente del proveedor: cambia de motor de reservas cuando quieras, tu formulario sigue igual."

#. Author of the plugin
#: astro-booking-engine.php
